@DevPilot_Host = https://localhost:5001

### Health check
GET {{DevPilot_Host}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### JSON to C#
POST {{DevPilot_Host}}/api/json-to-csharp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "input": "{\"customer\":{\"id\":123,\"name\":\"Azam\"}}",
  "root": "CustomerResponse"
}

### Invalid request example
POST {{DevPilot_Host}}/api/json-to-csharp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "input": "",
  "root": "CustomerResponse"
}

### JSON formatting
POST {{DevPilot_Host}}/api/json/format
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"DevPilot","enabled":true}

### URL encode
POST {{DevPilot_Host}}/api/encoding/url/encode
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": "name=Azam & role=Principal Engineer"
}

### URL decode
POST {{DevPilot_Host}}/api/encoding/url/decode
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": "name%3DAzam%20%26%20role%3DPrincipal%20Engineer"
}
